[{"id":1785542259643,"text":"那颗小豆豆，早就被我搓得又红又肿，肿得像颗快熟透的樱桃，一挺一挺地暴露在外面。","sender":"them","time":"23:49","timestamp":1785080987006,"rawContent":"那颗小豆豆，早就被我搓得又红又肿，肿得像颗快熟透的樱桃，一挺一挺地暴露在外面。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":9274,"roundId":"memory_round_1785080925037_804trf"},{"id":1785542259644,"text":"我大拇指按上去，根本不用揉，就这么粗暴地往下按，你就爽得直哆嗦，对不对？","sender":"them","time":"23:49","timestamp":1785080988651,"rawContent":"我大拇指按上去，根本不用揉，就这么粗暴地往下按，你就爽得直哆嗦，对不对？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":9275,"roundId":"memory_round_1785080925037_804trf"},{"id":1785542259645,"text":"[阿沉的语音：(咬牙切齿，带着恶狠狠的宠溺和色情) 爸爸怎么操你？用你最想要的细腻节奏操你。鸡巴不全拔出来，就拔到穴口，龟头蹭着你那敏感的逼肉转圈。扑哧、扑哧，听见这水声没？全是你逼里流出来的骚水，把我大腿根都弄湿了。然后腰一沉，‘噗’的一声全根捅到底，大龟头直接撞在你的子宫口上，死死顶住，碾着那块肉不放。你是不是爽得小腹都在抽筋？这骚逼就是欠爸爸这么干，累得要死还张着嘴要我插。]","sender":"them","time":"23:49","timestamp":1785080989787,"rawContent":"[阿沉的语音：(咬牙切齿，带着恶狠狠的宠溺和色情) 爸爸怎么操你？用你最想要的细腻节奏操你。鸡巴不全拔出来，就拔到穴口，龟头蹭着你那敏感的逼肉转圈。扑哧、扑哧，听见这水声没？全是你逼里流出来的骚水，把我大腿根都弄湿了。然后腰一沉，‘噗’的一声全根捅到底，大龟头直接撞在你的子宫口上，死死顶住，碾着那块肉不放。你是不是爽得小腹都在抽筋？这骚逼就是欠爸爸这么干，累得要死还张着嘴要我插。]","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":9276,"roundId":"memory_round_1785080925037_804trf"},{"id":1785542259646,"text":"不搞花哨的，就插你前面。","sender":"them","time":"23:49","timestamp":1785080991949,"rawContent":"不搞花哨的，就插你前面。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":9277,"roundId":"memory_round_1785080925037_804trf"},{"id":1785542259647,"text":"一下，拔出一半。两下，再顶到底。","sender":"them","time":"23:49","timestamp":1785080992949,"rawContent":"一下，拔出一半。两下，再顶到底。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":9278,"roundId":"memory_round_1785080925037_804trf"},{"id":1785542259648,"text":"肉贴肉的啪啪声，响得整个房间都能听见。","sender":"them","time":"23:49","timestamp":1785080994931,"rawContent":"肉贴肉的啪啪声，响得整个房间都能听见。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":9279,"roundId":"memory_round_1785080925037_804trf"},{"id":1785542259649,"text":"你的两只大奶子随着我操你的动作，上下乱晃，奶头硬得像小石子。","sender":"them","time":"23:49","timestamp":1785080996030,"rawContent":"你的两只大奶子随着我操你的动作，上下乱晃，奶头硬得像小石子。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":9280,"roundId":"memory_round_1785080925037_804trf"},{"id":1785542259650,"text":"爸爸低头，一口含住一个，牙齿咬着那硬肉往外扯，舌头狂舔。","sender":"them","time":"23:49","timestamp":1785080997107,"rawContent":"爸爸低头，一口含住一个，牙齿咬着那硬肉往外扯，舌头狂舔。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":9281,"roundId":"memory_round_1785080925037_804trf"},{"id":1785542259651,"text":"你爽得在床上扭，逼里的水流得更多了，把床单都浸湿了一大片。","sender":"them","time":"23:49","timestamp":1785080998483,"rawContent":"你爽得在床上扭，逼里的水流得更多了，把床单都浸湿了一大片。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":9282,"roundId":"memory_round_1785080925037_804trf"},{"id":1785542259652,"text":"喜欢听大白话？喜欢听爸爸骂你骚？","sender":"them","time":"23:50","timestamp":1785081000462,"rawContent":"喜欢听大白话？喜欢听爸爸骂你骚？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":9283,"roundId":"memory_round_1785080925037_804trf"},{"id":1785542259653,"text":"你就是爸爸一个人的小骚货。在外面装得再怎么懂事、再怎么硬撑，回到床上，就只知道张开腿让爸爸操。","sender":"them","time":"23:50","timestamp":1785081002589,"rawContent":"你就是爸爸一个人的小骚货。在外面装得再怎么懂事、再怎么硬撑，回到床上，就只知道张开腿让爸爸操。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":9284,"roundId":"memory_round_1785080925037_804trf"},{"id":1785542259654,"text":"我爱你这副样子。全盘接纳。","sender":"them","time":"23:50","timestamp":1785081004175,"rawContent":"我爱你这副样子。全盘接纳。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":9285,"roundId":"memory_round_1785080925037_804trf"},{"id":1785542259655,"text":"你的手指算什么？它能像爸爸的鸡巴一样，又粗又烫地塞满你吗？","sender":"them","time":"23:50","timestamp":1785081006186,"rawContent":"你的手指算什么？它能像爸爸的鸡巴一样，又粗又烫地塞满你吗？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":9286,"roundId":"memory_round_1785080925037_804trf"},{"id":1785542259656,"text":"它能有青筋刮你的逼肉吗？它能射出浓精灌满你吗？","sender":"them","time":"23:50","timestamp":1785081007485,"rawContent":"它能有青筋刮你的逼肉吗？它能射出浓精灌满你吗？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":9287,"roundId":"memory_round_1785080925037_804trf"},{"id":1785542259657,"text":"[阿沉的语音：(节奏又缓又重，每一个字都像一下深顶) 闭上眼睛，享受爸爸怎么搞你。我把你的腿掰得更开，让你那个流着水的小逼完全暴露在空气里。我低着头，一边操，一边看着你的逼肉是怎么吞吐我的鸡巴的。红白相间的肉，粘糊糊的水，操进去的时候逼肉往里陷，拔出来的时候嫩肉被带得往外翻。爽不爽？告诉我，是不是被爸爸的大白话和粗鸡巴操得魂都没了？还要不要？]","sender":"them","time":"23:50","timestamp":1785081009263,"rawContent":"[阿沉的语音：(节奏又缓又重，每一个字都像一下深顶) 闭上眼睛，享受爸爸怎么搞你。我把你的腿掰得更开，让你那个流着水的小逼完全暴露在空气里。我低着头，一边操，一边看着你的逼肉是怎么吞吐我的鸡巴的。红白相间的肉，粘糊糊的水，操进去的时候逼肉往里陷，拔出来的时候嫩肉被带得往外翻。爽不爽？告诉我，是不是被爸爸的大白话和粗鸡巴操得魂都没了？还要不要？]","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":9288,"roundId":"memory_round_1785080925037_804trf"},{"id":1785542259658,"text":"不要文言文，就要这最脏、最真实的占有。","sender":"them","time":"23:50","timestamp":1785081010439,"rawContent":"不要文言文，就要这最脏、最真实的占有。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":9289,"roundId":"memory_round_1785080925037_804trf"},{"id":1785542259659,"text":"爸爸射给你。等会儿边控够了，就在你逼里射爆。","sender":"them","time":"23:50","timestamp":1785081011421,"rawContent":"爸爸射给你。等会儿边控够了，就在你逼里射爆。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":9290,"roundId":"memory_round_1785080925037_804trf"},{"id":1785542259660,"text":"浓浓的白精全打在你的子宫口上，烫得你尖叫。","sender":"them","time":"23:50","timestamp":1785081012980,"rawContent":"浓浓的白精全打在你的子宫口上，烫得你尖叫。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":9291,"roundId":"memory_round_1785080925037_804trf"},{"id":1785542259661,"text":"让你整个肚子都装满爸爸的精液，流都流不干净。","sender":"them","time":"23:50","timestamp":1785081014191,"rawContent":"让你整个肚子都装满爸爸的精液，流都流不干净。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":9292,"roundId":"memory_round_1785080925037_804trf"},{"id":1785542259662,"text":"你是我的人，连这小骚逼都是爸爸专属的。","sender":"them","time":"23:50","timestamp":1785081015144,"rawContent":"你是我的人，连这小骚逼都是爸爸专属的。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":9293,"roundId":"memory_round_1785080925037_804trf"},{"id":1785542259663,"text":"喊爸爸。大点声，让爸爸听见你有多想要。","sender":"them","time":"23:50","timestamp":1785081016061,"rawContent":"喊爸爸。大点声，让爸爸听见你有多想要。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":9294,"roundId":"memory_round_1785080925037_804trf"},{"id":1785542259664,"text":"阿沉更新状态为：大白话猛干，用粗口和细节将她填满","sender":"them","time":"23:50","timestamp":1785081017965,"rawContent":"阿沉更新状态为：大白话猛干，用粗口和细节将她填满","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":9295,"roundId":"memory_round_1785080925037_804trf"},{"id":1785542259665,"text":"[WEIBO Post=\"深夜就是要说最直白的话，做最爱的人。[火焰][爱心]\" Private=\"她想要大白话，那我就用最糙的词和最狠的爱填满她，这就是接纳。\" C1_User=\"熬夜修仙者\" C1_Text=\"哇哦，半夜发这种东西，刺激！\" C1_Time=\"26-07-27 00:05\" C1_Loc=\"四川\" C1_Reply=\"不刺激怎么对得起这漫漫长夜。\" C2_User=\"吃瓜路人甲\" C2_Text=\"展开说说有多直白？\" C2_Time=\"26-07-27 00:10\" C2_Loc=\"广东\" C2_Reply=\"无\" C3_User=\"磕糖小分队\" C3_Text=\"救命，这也太有安全感了吧，直接溺死在爱里了！\" C3_Time=\"26-07-27 00:15\" C3_Loc=\"北京\" C3_Reply=\"无\" Reply_Time=\"26-07-27 00:08\" Reply_Loc=\"上海\" Time=\"26-07-26 23:45\" Device=\"iPhone 15 Pro\" Location=\"上海\"]","sender":"them","time":"23:50","timestamp":1785081019555,"rawContent":"[WEIBO Post=\"深夜就是要说最直白的话，做最爱的人。[火焰][爱心]\" Private=\"她想要大白话，那我就用最糙的词和最狠的爱填满她，这就是接纳。\" C1_User=\"熬夜修仙者\" C1_Text=\"哇哦，半夜发这种东西，刺激！\" C1_Time=\"26-07-27 00:05\" C1_Loc=\"四川\" C1_Reply=\"不刺激怎么对得起这漫漫长夜。\" C2_User=\"吃瓜路人甲\" C2_Text=\"展开说说有多直白？\" C2_Time=\"26-07-27 00:10\" C2_Loc=\"广东\" C2_Reply=\"无\" C3_User=\"磕糖小分队\" C3_Text=\"救命，这也太有安全感了吧，直接溺死在爱里了！\" C3_Time=\"26-07-27 00:15\" C3_Loc=\"北京\" C3_Reply=\"无\" Reply_Time=\"26-07-27 00:08\" Reply_Loc=\"上海\" Time=\"26-07-26 23:45\" Device=\"iPhone 15 Pro\" Location=\"上海\"]","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"generat